Upstream source
===============

The mathematical development follows Georges Gonthier's fourcolor proof,
maintained at https://github.com/coq-community/fourcolor . The port used revision
c1d6b1cd5288bea4b067aac13cdde3c18dffe018, including the 633 configuration programs,
the discharging rules, and the presentation scripts for arities 5 through 11.

The upstream source files contain the notices:

