Some upstream files carry a shorter year range within that period. The notices
above are reproduced for the adapted material; the complete upstream licence,
including its warranty and liability limitations, is in LICENSES/CeCILL-B.txt.
This Isabelle port is not an official release of the upstream fourcolor project.

The mathematical proof of Robertson, Sanders, Seymour, and Thomas and Gonthier's
formalisation are cited in document/root.bib and discussed in the proof document.
The foundational list/path and finite-orbit conventions also follow the
SSReflect and Mathematical Components libraries: https://math-comp.github.io/ .
The Isabelle code, executable encodings, and explicit-carrier representation
contain substantial adaptations. The upstream authors do not endorse this port.

